  (text "Waveshare ESP32-S3-Touch-LCD-2 on two 1x14 sockets" (at 20.32 25.4 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 111fe46c-8cf3-5076-9f21-554c1bc35201))
  (text "Port power: VBAT -> MT3608 boost 5.1 V -> one high-side switch per port -> B0503S (channel sheet). EN high = port on." (at 63.5 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 49153f35-4d32-5179-aebb-f4cff5c35ab3))
  (text "EN1..EN4 = GPIO16/17/18/10 (100k pull-down: off until enabled). SWAP1..4 = GPIO2/4/6/7: high = cross pins 3 and 6." (at 63.5 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4f39dff3-455d-5ceb-af76-2f041fa8f56d))
  (text "J3: I2C (GPIO47/48), spare GPIO8, boot log TX (GPIO43), USB 5 V. J4/J5: battery, either plug, reverse protected by Q5." (at 20.32 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2235d88f-9d19-5629-ab48-0a1466ec3f98))
